ollama -- Think of Ollama as a way to run an AI model on your own computer without necessarily needing an API key.
- Runs models such as oLlama.
- Can generate answers and summarize text.
- Useful for local AI projects and privacy.
Example: Ask Ollama, "Explain the employee leave policy."

